  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\mathrm{x}(3 \\lambda+1)+\\mathrm{y}(7 \\lambda+2)=17 \\lambda+5 \\\\\n& (\\mathrm{x}+2 \\mathrm{y}-5)+\\lambda(3 \\mathrm{x}+7 \\mathrm{y}-17)=0<br/>\\end{aligned}$<br/>intersection of family of lines<br/>$\\mathrm{P}(1,2)$<br/>Let $\\mathrm{Q}(3,6)$<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\mathrm{d}=\\mathrm{PQ}=\\sqrt{2^2+4^2}=\\sqrt{20} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~d}^2=20<br/>\\end{aligned}$<br/>option (1)",
    "image": null
